title: >-
  GFFBase: Rust-accelerated GFF3/GTF parser with a DuckDB-backed
  storage engine and zero-copy PyArrow interface
message: >-
  This repository describes the unreleased 0.2.0rc1 candidate. Cite a tagged
  release when possible; if GFFBase contributes to your research, please cite it.
